strings.en:
{1c:1a}{0b:08}【 Jessica 】{0b:09}
I only climbed up there once. Enemies all
over the place, flames roaring
everywhere...{1a}Let's just say it wasn't the kind of
place that lets you stroll on through.{1a}That's why I asked you along, you know.{0c:fe}
